{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GYPKn33GNgydcSm649siUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## US-014: React `useLiveUpload` hook\n\n### New files\n- **`assets/useLiveUploadReact.ts`** — The React hook implementation mirroring the Vue `useLiveUpload()` composable\n- **`assets/useLiveUploadReact.test.ts`** — 27 tests covering all functionality\n\n### Modified files\n- **`assets/index.ts`** — Added export of `useLiveUploadReact` and `UseLiveUploadReactReturn` type\n\n### Hook API (`useLiveUploadReact`)\n```typescript\nfunction useLiveUpload(uploadConfig: UploadConfig, options: UploadOptions): UseLiveUploadReactReturn\n```\n\nReturns:\n- **`entries`** — Current upload entries from the config\n- **`progress`** — Overall progress 0-100 derived from entries\n- **`valid`** — Whether there are no upload errors\n- **`inputEl`** — The hidden `<input type=\"file\">` element\n- **`showFilePicker()`** — Opens the native file picker dialog\n- **`addFiles(files)`** — Manually enqueue files (e.g. from drag-drop), accepts `File[]` or `DataTransfer`\n- **`submit()`** — Submit all queued files to LiveView\n- **`cancel(ref?)`** — Cancel a specific entry or all entries\n- **`clear()`** — Reset the hidden input\n\n### Key implementation details\n- Creates a hidden `<form>` with `<input type=\"file\">` in the LiveView element, with all required Phoenix upload attributes (`data-phx-hook`, `data-phx-upload-ref`, etc.)\n- Updates `data-phx-active-refs`, `data-phx-done-refs`, and `data-phx-preflighted-refs` as entries change\n- Guards against `DataTransfer` being unavailable (e.g. in server/test environments)\n- Properly cleans up DOM on unmount\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":90180,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h